# Reflex: 30-second social clip (Community Choice). Script and shot list: docs/SOCIAL_CLIP.md
caption
train off
guard on
wait-ai 20
say START RECORDING NOW (phone on the beam, dashboard in presentation mode behind it)
wait 2
caption This AI is about to fail on purpose.
wait 3
inject flip
caption Guardian ON: the ball stays.
wait 5
clear
caption Guardian OFF:
guard off
inject flip
wait 5
clear
guard on
caption Reflex on QNX: AI you can let near a real machine.
wait 6
caption
